From e9786e531aa63013954bc54eba8b161671fd70f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Deng, Bing" <bing.deng@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 15:39:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Reformat laserMapping.cpp to match the project's real
 clang-format style

Super-linter's CLANG_FORMAT validator was failing on this file
because it had never actually been run through amr-common's
Google-based .clang-format config (now wired into the pipeline).
Reformat the whole file against it; no logic changes.

Signed-off-by: Deng, Bing <bing.deng@intel.com>
---
 src/laserMapping.cpp | 2236 ++++++++++++++++++++++--------------------
 1 file changed, 1146 insertions(+), 1090 deletions(-)

